@startuml
skinparam lifelineStrategy solid
autonumber
title Diagrama Historial 4: POST /api/v1/supervisor/discrepancies/orders/:orderId/review (Revisión Parcial o Total)

actor "Supervisor" as Supervisor
participant "App Móvil / Web" as App
participant "Gateway Controller" as Gateway
participant "Supervisor Review Service" as Service
participant "Transaction Manager\n(QueryRunner)" as TX
participant "transport_orders DB" as OrdersDB
participant "count_sessions DB\n(transport_order_count_sessions)" as SessionDB
participant "session_items DB\n(transport_order_count_session_items)" as SessionItemsDB
participant "truck_inventories DB" as InvDB
participant "order_histories DB\n(transport_order_histories)" as HistoryDB

Supervisor -> App: Selecciona modo de revisión: "PARTIAL" (solo observados) o "FULL" (total)
Supervisor -> App: Ingresa cantidades verificadas, dictamen de merma y plasma firma
App -> Gateway: POST /api/v1/supervisor/discrepancies/orders/100451/review\n(SupervisorReviewPayloadDto)
Gateway -> Service: processSupervisorDiscrepancyReview(orderId: 100451, payload, supervisorId)

Service -> TX: 1. startTransaction()
activate TX

Service -> SessionDB: 2. insertCountSession(orderId, 'SUPERVISOR_DISCREPANCY', supervisorId)
note right of SessionDB
  Registra sesión:
  - session_type = 'SUPERVISOR_DISCREPANCY'
  - status = 'COMPLETED'
  - executor_role = 'SUPERVISOR'
  - executor_id = supervisorId
  - completed_at = NOW()
end note
SessionDB --> Service: newSessionId: 201

Service -> SessionItemsDB: 3. insertCountSessionItems(201, payload.items)
note right of SessionItemsDB
  Registra por cada producto revisado:
  - counted_qty = item.authorizedQty
  - variance_qty = item.varianceQty
  - item_status = 'APPROVED'
  - observation = item.observation
end note
SessionItemsDB --> Service: ok

Service -> InvDB: 4. updateTruckInventoriesOfficial(100451, payload.items, supervisorId)
note right of InvDB
  Consolida inventario de camión:
  - loaded_qty = item.authorizedQty
  - variance_qty = item.varianceQty
  - status = 'APPROVED'
  - verified_supervisor_id = supervisorId
end note
InvDB --> Service: ok

Service -> OrdersDB: 5. updateOrderStatus(100451, 'CHECKED_OK')
OrdersDB --> Service: ok

Service -> HistoryDB: 6. insertOrderHistory(100451, 'VALIDATE SUP', 'Revisión supervisor completada y carga aprobada')
HistoryDB --> Service: ok

Service -> TX: 7. commitTransaction()
deactivate TX

Service --> Gateway: 200 OK (SupervisorReviewResult: { status: 'APPROVED', sessionId: 201 })
Gateway --> App: 200 OK
App --> Supervisor: Notificación de Éxito • Carga Consolidada y Lista para Salida
@enduml
